---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms | Sounds So Far"
  description="The basic terms for using this site and applying to Sounds So Far."
  noindex
>
<main>
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Terms</h2>
    <p class="legal-notice">This is a plain-language draft and has not been reviewed by a lawyer. Don't treat it as final.</p>

    <p class="lead">These are the basic terms for using this site and applying to play Sounds So Far.</p>

    <h3>The application</h3>
    <p class="lead">Submitting the artist application doesn't guarantee a spot on the trailer or at the open mic. We review applications and reach out if it's a fit.</p>

    <h3>Recording and posting</h3>
    <p class="lead">If you're invited to play, by checking the agreement box on the application you're agreeing to let us record your set and interview and post them, live and afterward, on video platforms and the podcast. You keep ownership of your own music.</p>

    <h3>Age</h3>
    <p class="lead">Artists under 18 need a parent or guardian to agree on their behalf.</p>

    <h3>Using this site</h3>
    <p class="lead">Don't use the forms on this site to send spam, abuse, or anything illegal. We can remove access for anyone who does.</p>

    <h3>Changes</h3>
    <p class="lead">We may update these terms as the tour and the site develop. Check back here for the current version.</p>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
</Layout>
